 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูลถูกตัดออกแล้วโดย mark_dnt.py",
 "strings": {
  "Seriously, what's gotten into him all of a sudden?": "",
  "You're right. Why be a \"Mibu Wolf\" of all things?": "",
  "But, you know, he's not one of them yet...": "",
  "He might say he's a swordsman, but we have no idea if he can back that up.": "",
  "Are you worried, Oryo-chan?": "",
  "...No.": "",
  "Why should I be?": "",
  "Well, there's got to be better work for Hajime-san than the Shinsengumi.": "",
  "Can you think of anything, Oryo-chan?": "",
  "Huh? Well...": "",
  "Hmmm...": "",
  "I can't imagine Hajime-san working at all.": "",
  "Me neither.": "",
  "Hajime-san, are you sure you won't change your mind?": "",
  "Isn't there some other job out there?": "",
  "She's right. You'd be sending yourself to an early grave.": "",
  "*sigh* Seems there's no getting through to him.": "",
  "Okami-san, am I harping on too much about the rent?": "",
  "Huh? Oh, you think maybe that's why he's working for the Shinsengumi?": "",
  "That's not for you to worry about, Oryo-chan.": "",
  "You don't think...?": "",
  "If this is about your tab here, we can be flexible.": "",
  "Why not take your time finding a job?": "",
  "See? Even Okami-san is saying that the rent can wait.": "",
  "So think this over, please?": "",
  "Oryo-chan, did you put away the futons?": "",
  "Yes, all done.": "",
  "Okay, then can I leave the kitchen to you?": "",
  "Yes, ma'am.": "",
  "You know, Oryo-chan, you're really glowing these days.": "",
  "Huh? I am?": "",
  "Perhaps you've met someone special?": "",
  "Okami-san, what are you trying to say?": "",
  "I haven't met anyone like that.": "",
  "Positive.": "",
  "Okami-san, I've finished cleaning upstairs.": "",
  "Oh, good. Thank you.": "",
  "Hello and welcome.": "",
  "Can you give us just a moment, please?": "",
  "We'll set you up right away.": "",
  "Oryo-chan, if you'd please?": "",
  "Hello, thank you for waiting.": "",
  "I thought I'd put it right here...": "",
  "I don't see it.": "",
  "If you'll excuse me.": "",
  "Oh, right, I had to clean upstairs next...": "",
  "Saito Hajime, eh?": "",
  "He definitely knows his way around a sword.": "",
  "He'll likely get along just fine.": "",
  "Saito.": "",
  "Someone of your caliber will have plenty of missions on 'is plate.": "",
  "Then you'll be seein' so much Tennen Rishin style,": "",
  "you'll wanna vomit!": "",
  "What're you still doin' here?": "",
  "Weren't ya meetin' with the deputy chief tonight?": "",
  "You can do whatever ya want 'til then.": "",
  "As I recall, you've already been hearin' the rumors about Soji.": "",
  "I dunno what ya felt like after ya fought 'im,": "",
  "but I doubt there's anyone in Kyo who can go up against the guy.": "",
  "That's how good he is.": "",
  "Don't forget, the deputy chief's the one who summoned ya.": "",
  "And for all intents and purposes, he's our commander.": "",
  "Ya oughta visit him tonight.": "",
  "I oversee almost all the tryouts, and lemme tell ya,": "",
  "nobody 'sides you ever went toe to toe with me.": "",
  "Think that prob'ly piqued the deputy chief's interest.": "",
  "*sigh* Another girl, another blind eye turned for some man...": "",
  "Why fall for Hajime-san of all people?": "",
  "Talk about a waste. She's such a nice girl, too.": "",
  "I hope Hajime-san will point things in the right direction...": "",
  "But knowing him, we won't get so much as a few senseless grunts.": "",
  "Go look for Oryo-chan, will you?": "",
  "I don't know where she went, but maybe try over near Kamo River?": "",
  "Hajime-san, did you really not notice Oryo-chan's feelings for you?": "",
  "Or are you just trying to hide your embarrassment?": "",
  "Well, it doesn't matter.": "",
  "Just don't make her cry anymore, all right?": "",
  "Hehe...": "",
  "Well, Oryo-chan certainly seems happy.": "",
  "In any case, I'm glad she's here.": "",
  "Dinnertime's usually busiest for us...": "",
  "I don't know where I'd be without Oryo-chan's help.": "",
  "And speaking of, I'm a little surprised she came back so easily.": "",
  "I assumed you would have a harder time...": "",
  "Truly, well done.": "",
  "A guest was saying he wanted to meet you...": "",
  "He said he'd be at Kiyomizu Temple.": "",
  "He said he'd be waiting for you.": "",
  "Could he be from Tosa? It sounded like he had an accent.": "",
  "Maybe go see what he has to say?": "",
  "I don't know where you're headed, but please stay safe.": "",
  "Enjoy your evening.": "",
  "Seeing him in that haori, it feels like he really is part of the Shinsengumi now.": "",
  "It does.": "",
  "But Hajime-san is different from the rest of them...": "",
  "Yes, I think so, too.": "",
  "Well, Hajime-san, now you're really going to have to work your butt off.": "",
  "I had to add an extra charge for the hemming job.": "",
  "That's right. So be sure you're working hard, you hear?": "",
  "For all the fuss we made, that haori does look good on you.": "",
  "Don't you think, Oryo-chan?": "",
  "...Yes.": "",
  "I think you look handsome.": "",
  "Are you done working for the day?": "",
  "Good for you to get some time off.": "",
  "Doesn't a captain have duties like handing down orders?": "",
  "I must say I can't picture you doing such a thing, Hajime-san.": "",
  "You still have work?": "",
  "Awfully busy for someone who's so new.": "",
  "Just take care, it's getting dark out there.": "",
  "Oh, back already?": "",
  "Did you forget something?": "",
  "You're rather careless sometimes, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Get it together now, Captain!": "",
  "How does the haori fit you now?": "",
  "If it's hard to move any at all, let me know.": "",
  "I'll fix it for you.": "",
  "Welcome back, Hajime-san.": "",
  "How was work today?": "",
  "Don't push yourself too hard, all right?": "",
  "You're back, Hajime-san?": "",
  "Um... Did something happen?": "",
  "You don't seem like your usual self...": "",
  "Hajime-san, what happened?": "",
  "Your don't look like yourself...": "",
  "To go after the Emperor...": "",
  "What sort of madness is this?": "",
  "And to set the town ablaze on top of it...": "",
  "Forty loyalist shishi...": "",
  "Things are getting strange.": "",
  "There's still time until nightfall.": "",
  "I should do what I need to do before then...": "",
  "Today I get to see what you're really made of.": "",
  "...What's wrong?": "",
  "Can't forgive someone for attacking the Emperor?": "",
  "Go ahead and crack down on the Loyalists.": "",
  "If you can.": "",
  "All divisions are ordered to carry out normal duties.": "",
  "The shishi will detect any movement by the Shinsengumi.": "",
  "I'll conduct the patrol rounds myself.": "",
  "Are you not going?": "",
  "Seems the deputy chief wants to speak with you.": "",
  "Hmph. I wonder what for.": "",
  "I'd pick up the pace, if I were you.": "",
  "Don't keep the deputy chief waiting.": "",
  "Evening already...": "",
  "The time has come to show our loyalty to country.": "",
  "Looks like rain tonight...": "",
  "We'll wash this town in blood.": "",
  "I'm sure you're in the Shinsengumi out of patriotism,": "",
  "but you haven't earned my full trust just yet.": "",
  "We'll decide tonight whether you're capable of being captain of the Third Division.": "",
  "The Deputy Chief has ordered us to conduct a sortie.": "",
  "So you need to hurry it up!": "",
  "If you know what's good for you as a newcomer, that is.": "",
  "I doubt I have to tell you this...": "",
  "but you shouldn't talk about the Crow.": "",
  "No need to make a fuss over one lousy informant.": "",
  "I wanted to ask you, Tet-chan...": "",
  "The inn over there...": "",
  "Must keep some dangerous clientele, eh?": "",
  "I'm too scared to find out myself.": "",
  "Oh, you're better off not goin' near that place.": "",
  "Beggar": "",
  "Place gets overrun with those sorts now and again.": "",
  "Yes, I should steer clear, then.": "",
  "Yep, yep.": "",
  "Don't wanna get too familiar...": "",
  "Place like that, the Shinsengumi could cut you down, and you'd have no one to blame but yourself.": "",
  "Can't roll the dice if ya wind up dead, after all.": "",
  "You gambling again? Don't let it ruin you.": "",
  "Heheh, it's one thing I just can't seem to quit.": "",
  "Saito-san... It's Inspector Yamazaki.": "",
  "Could you reduce your patrol of this area?": "",
  "Some of the inspectors are conducting investigations in disguise.": "",
  "And people will clam up if they see pale blue haori around.": "",
  "In any case, we're going to take charge here.": "",
  "So by tonight,": "",
  "we should know where the shishi are meeting.": "",
  "Beg your pardon. We're in the midst of searching for the shishi's meeting location.": "",
  "Pretend like you don't know me, and move along.": "",
  "Hello, Saito-san... It's Inspector Yamazaki.": "",
  "I apologize for being blunt,": "",
  "but an informant named Crow was killed by one of our own in Fushimi.": "",
  "It turned out to be Matsubara-san who cut him down.": "",
  "But you were nearby, apparently.": "",
  "Not saying that means anything, taken by itself.": "",
  "But I'd appreciate it if you laid low until the raid tonight.": "",
  "We don't want to raise the shishi's suspicions.": "",
  "Good day...": "",
  "Agh, figures I gotta be on duty.": "",
  "I just wanna bust in and start cuttin' 'em down, dammit.": "",
  "Tch. Not like I can loaf around the barracks, either...": "",
  "Man, this sucks.": "",
  "What should I eat today?": "",
  "Well done making the rounds.": "",
  "I just gotta say...": "",
  "You're lucky, being a newcomer...": "",
  "and getting to do a big job right away.": "",
  "Well, good luck getting any credit around here.": "",
  "Be ready to kiss up to Nagakura and the deputy chief, eh?": "",
  "I'm ready to go all out...": "",
  "Son of a... How long they expect me to wait!?": "",
  "If their meeting's at Shikokuya, I can kill 'em all myself.": "",
  "See who's praisin' who after that.": "",
  "Oh man, I can't wait.": "",
  "Damn, should I get goin'?": "",
  "What, are you itchin' to go too?": "",
  "You're probably pretty excited...": "",
  "thinking you're about to kill forty guys.": "",
  "You're on the same team as me, Shikokuya.": "",
  "Don't get any big ideas about proving yourself, and don't get in my way.": "",
  "Else I'll treat you like I will the shishi.": "",
  "Well, if you're gonna be a liability...": "",
  "you might as well die quick, like Tani and Suzuki!": "",
  "Urgh, think I ate too much.": "",
  "Eh, I think I'll be alright.": "",
  "It won't affect my duties. No sir.": "",
  "Maybe I should've taken a bath when I had time.": "",
  "Guess it won't matter once the blood starts flowin'.": "",
  "We've been cleared to head out.": "",
  "You lead the way.": "",
  "We'll save the main event for the end.": "",
  "Our job tonight is of paramount importance.": "",
  "But don't feel any pressure to prove yourself.": "",
  "Your reputation has been excellent ever since you captured Izo.": "",
  "The only thing you need to do now is put on a friendly face.": "",
  "It's not often forty shishi are in one place.": "",
  "That's a real opportunity for the Shinsengumi to make a name for itself.": "",
  "Bloodshed is certain, but failure is not an option.": "",
  "You were told to carry on until nightfall.": "",
  "Why don't you go make your rounds?": "",
  "Make sure to grab a bite before you go.": "",
  "I assume you have a favorite restaurant.": "",
  "I've got a favorite place myself.": "",
  "They have this unique cold noodle dish called reimen.": "",
  "Sorry. If you're not interested, just forget it.": "",
  "The target of our attack will be forty rebel shishi.": "",
  "Be ready.": "",
  "You'll need plenty of stamina for this.": "",
  "Setting fire to the palace...": "",
  "A shame that loyalist shishi should let things slip.": "",
  "We cannot afford to fail during tonight's attack...": "",
  "So we shall be ready to the greatest extent possible,": "",
  "though I don't know what our tactics will be exactly...": "",
  "Regardless, you should be ready, too.": "",
  "The loyalists involved with the plan...": "",
  "are backed into a corner now...": "",
  "because Choshu, the first loyalist clan, is being run out of Kyo.": "",
  "They will fight like lions tonight. They're willing to die for their cause.": ""
 }
}